        <activityName xml:lang="en">Switch, toggle type, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Switch, toggle type, at plant
The data represent a current toggle type switch, as applied in current information and communication technology (ICT). Material data are taken from product sheets of producers. The energy demand is estimated based on literature. Infrastructure and transport efforts rough estimations. The dataset represents 1 kg of toggle type switches with a weight of 29 gram/unit.;
UUID: 15173189-63c6-302e-9c80-fa64a8238f82
This dataset covers raw material input, energy consumption, infrastructure and transport efforts for the production of toggle type switches.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average switch production technology, based on literature and assumptions
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_15173189-63c6-302e-9c80-fa64a8238f82.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
